face-rendered:p001:m0005","quote":"高祖"},{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-022","source_id":"s-liangshu-022-current-rendered-shunzhi-sons-preface","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001","mention_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001:m0014","quote":"高祖"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"南史王氏傳依同書本紀、宗室傳與時序辨識，未採蕭氏遠祖譜接合。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_A","source_assertion_id":"a-liang-close-family-liangwu-father-shunzhi","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-006","source_id":"s-nanshi006-liang-close-family","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-006-liang-close-family","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-006-liang-close-family:p001","quote":"　　梁高祖武皇帝諱衍，字叔達，小字練兒，南蘭陵中都里人，姓蕭氏，與齊同承淮陰令整。整生皇高祖轄，位濟陰太守。轄生皇曾祖副子，位州治中從事。副子生皇祖道賜，位南台治書侍御史。道賜生皇考，諱順之，字文緯，于齊高帝為始族弟。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-006-liang-close-family:p001:m0009","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-006-liang-close-family:p001:m0093","source_term":"皇考"}],"interpretation_note":"明父子來源支援的一代家族路徑；字母為身份配置，不是全體/嫡子出生排行，不由同姓或帝號推祖先。"}},{"id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AAD","label":"廬陵王","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"廬陵王","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered:p002:m0005"]},{"surface":"廬陵威王續","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-xu-parent-rendered:p001:m0001"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-013","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered","source_id":"s-chenshu-013-ws1511906-rendered-xunlang","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered:p002","quote":"廬陵王","mention_id":"c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered:p002:m0005"},{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-xu-parent-rendered","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-xu-parent-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-xu-parent-rendered:p001","quote":"廬陵威王續","mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-xu-parent-rendered:p001:m0001"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"兩現役廬陵王義真、紹屬劉宋，田續／羊續亦異姓；梁書29完整廬陵威王續傳首及履歷確認本稱為梁廬陵王續。不由王號猜姓或憑近梁帝補家根。","family_path":{"parent_person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AA","connection":"father","source_assertion_id":"a-liang029-xu-father-liangwu","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-xu-parent-rendered","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-xu-parent-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-xu-parent-rendered:p001","quote":"廬陵威王續字世䐶，高祖第五子，天監八年，封廬陵郡王，邑二千戶。十年，拜輕車將軍、南彭城琅邪太守。十三年，轉會稽太守。十六年，爲都督江州諸軍事、雲麾將軍、江州刺史。普通元年，徵爲宣毅將軍，領石頭戍軍事。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-xu-parent-rendered:p001:m0001","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-xu-parent-rendered:p001:m0002","source_term":"高祖第五子"}],"interpretation_note":"梁書卷二十九廬陵威王續完整傳首明高祖第五子，父為已辨梁高祖衍；父族沿既有道賜/順之/衍根，不由王號或ID猜父。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-chenshu-013-ws1511906-rendered-xunlang","work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-013","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered:p002:m0005"],"paragraph_ids":["c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered:p002"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered:p002:m0005","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered:p002:m0005"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"s-liangshu-029-xu-parent-rendered","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-xu-parent-rendered","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-xu-parent-rendered:p001:m0001"],"paragraph_ids":["c-liangshu-029-xu-parent-rendered:p001"],